Package: duolingo
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: armel
Maintainer: Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>
Depends: libqtcore4, libqtgui4, libqt4-network, libqt4-declarative, libmeegotouchcore0, qt-components, libdeclarative-multimedia
Section: user/education
Priority: optional
Description: Duolingo for the N9 and N950
 Lessons from your own Duolingo course: the path, the exercises and the
 practice, with the progress written back to your account.
 .
 Not a port of the Android app and not made by Duolingo: an own client
 against the same interface the web front-end uses. HTTPS goes through a
 small Rust helper beside it, because Qt 4.7 on Harmattan cannot do TLS 1.2.
 Exercises needing a microphone or handwriting, and stories, chess and
 maths, are not in this edition.
Maemo-Display-Name: Duolingo
